"new-job-and-promotion\"},{\"id\":149,\"name\":\"Pink\",\"slug\":\"pink\"},{\"id\":188,\"name\":\"PINK OCTOBER\",\"slug\":\"pink-october\"}],\"tags\":[],\"wp_ar_id\":17174,\"wp_en_id\":16394}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '100', '370.00', '370.00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '1', '1', '10.00', NULL, NULL, '3_months', 'Other', NULL, NULL, '2026-10-01 09:50:15', '2026-10-13 12:46:55', NULL);
INSERT INTO `products` (`id`, `source_id`, `user_id`, `category_id`, `production_id`, `sub_category_id`, `child_category_id`, `name`, `slug`, `slug_ar`, `sub_title`, `sku`, `image`, `gallery`, `description`, `meta_data`, `meta_tag_title`, `meta_tag_description`, `meta_tag_keywords`, `model`, `author`, `year`, `quantity`, `mrp`, `price`, `number_of_pages`, `book_language`, `weight`, `isbn`, `isbn10`, `isbn13`, `is_visible`, `is_subscription_enabled`, `subscription_discount_percentage`, `subscription_frequencies`, `subscription_durations`, `subscription_min_duration`, `type`, `updated_by`, `published_at`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `vendor_id`) VALUES ('107', '17176', NULL, '[31,42,48,18,21,23,1]', NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"G173\",\"ar\":\"G173\"}', 'g173', 'g173-2', '{\"en\":\"Be the one who lightens up their day! with a luxurious vase arrangement featuring pink lilies and hydrangeas, baby orchids, and white eustoma. This bouquet is beautifully complemented with pink roses, baby pink roses, our magical touches of pink limonium, lush green steel grass, and elegant wooden salix sticks.\\nThis gift is a beautiful way to express the deep feelings you hold in your heart for someone special!\\nApproximate dimensions: Height 50 cm, Width 35 cm.\",\"ar\":\"اجعل يوم من تحب مليء بالحب والسعادة وأرسل باقة في مزهرية فاخرة تحتوي على أزهار الليليوم والهيدرينجيا الوردي مع البيبي أوركيد والاستوما الأبيض, بالإضافة الى الجوري والبيبي الجوري الوردي ولمساتنا السحرية من الليمينوم الوردي و الخضارات من الستيل غراس ومع اعواد خشب السليكس.\\nهذه الهدية هي طريقة جميلة لإظهار المشاعر التي تكنها بداخل قلبك تجاه من تحب!\\nالارتفاع حوالي 50 سم.\\nالعرض 35 سم.\"}', '1106', 'products/2023/06/front-101.png', '[\"products\\/gallery\\/2023\\/06\\/front-101.png\",\"products\\/gallery\\/2023\\/06\\/103-left.png\",\"products\\/gallery\\/2023\\/06\\/102-12.png\",\"products\\/gallery\\/2023\\/06\\/104.png\"]', NULL, '{\"type\":\"simple\",\"featured\":false,\"weight\":\"\",\"dimensions\":{\"length\":\"\",\"width\":\"\",\"height\":\"\"},\"categories\":[{\"id\":167,\"name\":\"All Flowers\",\"slug\":\"all-flowers\"},{\"id\":178,\"name\":\"Bridal Bouquet\",\"slug\":\"bridal-bouquet\"},{\"id\":184,\"name\":\"For Her\",\"slug\":\"for-her\"},{\"id\":154,\"name\":\"For Mother\",\"slug\":\"for-mother\"},{\"id\":157,\"name\":\"Get well\",\"slug\":\"get-well\"},{\"id\":159,\"name\":\"New job and promotion\",\"slug\":\"new-job-and-promotion\"},{\"id\":137,\"name\":\"Ocassions\",\"slug\":\"ocassions\"}],\"tags\":[],\"wp_ar_id\":17176,\"wp_en_id\":16398}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '100', '425.00', '425.00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '1', '1', '10.00', NULL, NULL, '3_months', 'Other', NULL, NULL, '2026-10-01 09:50:15', '2026-10-13 12:46:49', NULL);
