ine\",\"slug\":\"valentine\"}],\"tags\":[],\"wp_ar_id\":17676,\"wp_en_id\":14660}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '100', '700.00', '700.00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '1', '1', '10.00', NULL, NULL, '3_months', 'Other', NULL, NULL, '2026-10-01 09:50:49', '2026-10-13 13:11:10', NULL);
INSERT INTO `products` (`id`, `source_id`, `user_id`, `category_id`, `production_id`, `sub_category_id`, `child_category_id`, `name`, `slug`, `slug_ar`, `sub_title`, `sku`, `image`, `gallery`, `description`, `meta_data`, `meta_tag_title`, `meta_tag_description`, `meta_tag_keywords`, `model`, `author`, `year`, `quantity`, `mrp`, `price`, `number_of_pages`, `book_language`, `weight`, `isbn`, `isbn10`, `isbn13`, `is_visible`, `is_subscription_enabled`, `subscription_discount_percentage`, `subscription_frequencies`, `subscription_durations`, `subscription_min_duration`, `type`, `updated_by`, `published_at`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `vendor_id`) VALUES ('301', '17678', NULL, '[31,48,6,20,8,47]', NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"G305\",\"ar\":\"G305\"}', 'g305', 'g305-2', '{\"en\":\"Our qualified florists have designed this exquisite bouquet that will make you the reason for their dazzling smile as this hand bouquet is a gesture that will make a lasting impression! You will confidently lighten up their day by gifting a luxurious bouquet that consists of striking White Hydrangea, and 5 Red Roses mixed in with White Lilium and 2 Red Baby Roses and White Baby Roses which are arranged with 4 Red chrysanthemum, White Eustoma and Red Hypericum along with White Waxflower and White Gypsophila that adds a sense of peace and calmness.\\nThe height is approximately 40 cm to 50 cm.\\nThe width is approximately 20 cm to 30 cm.\",\"ar\":\"عبّر عن مشاعرك وأحاسيسك من خلال الأزهار الطبيعية. امنحهم حبك من خلال إهداء باقة فاخرة تتكون من الهيدرينجيا البيضاء و5 روز احمر مع الليليوم و2 بيبي روز احمر وبيبي روز الأبيض. قام خبرائنا بتصميم هذه الباقة الرائعة التي ستجعلك سبب سعادتهم لأنها مكونة من أجمل الأزهار مثل زهور 4 كريزنتيموم احمر والإيستوما البيضاء مع 4 هايبركم الأحمر والواكس فلاور والجيبسوفيليا البيضاء التي ستضيف شعورًا بالسلام والهدوء لحياة أحبتك.\\nالارتفاع حوالي 40 سم إلى 50 سم.\\nالعرض حوالي 20 سم إلى 30 سم.\"}', '403', 'products/2023/06/g30520jeddah20flower20delivery-600x600-1.jpg', '[\"products\\/gallery\\/2023\\/06\\/g30520jeddah20flower20delivery-600x600-1.jpg\",\"products\\/gallery\\/2023\\/06\\/g30520send20flower20to20jeddah-600x600-1.jpg\",\"products\\/gallery\\/2023\\/06\\/g30520send20flowers20to20jeddah202-600x600-1.jpg\",\"products\\/gallery\\/2023\\/06\\/g305-send-flowers-to-jeddah-600x600-1.jpg\"]', NULL, '{\"type\":\"simple\",\"featured\":false,\"weight\":\"\",\"dimensions\":{\"length\":\"\",\"width\":\"\",\"height\":\"\"},\"categories\":[{\"id\":167,\"name\":\"All Flowers\",\"slug\":\"all-flowers\"},{\"id\":184,\"name\":\"For Her\",\"slug\":\"for-her\"},{\"id\":142,\"name\":\"For Him\",\"slug\":\"for-him\"},{\"id\":156,\"name\":\"Love\",\"slug\":\"love\"},{\"id\":144,\"name\":\"Red\",\"slug\":\"red\"},{\"id\":183,\"name\":\"Valentine\",\"slug\":\"valentine\"}],\"tags\":[],\"wp_ar_id\":17678,\"wp_en_id\":15002}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '100', '270.00', '270.00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '1', '1', '10.00', NULL, NULL, '3_months', 'Other', NULL, NULL, '2026-10-01 09:50:54', '2026-10-13 13:03:08', NULL);
