01-1200x1200w-1.jpg\",\"products\\/gallery\\/2023\\/06\\/screenshot-2022-06-20-155401jpg1-1200x1200w.jpg\",\"products\\/gallery\\/2023\\/06\\/screenshot-2022-06-20-155401jpg0-1200x1200w.jpg\"]', '{\"en\":null,\"ar\":\"<p>A gorgeous vase bouquet consists of Pink Hydrangea, Pink Rose, Pink Lilium, along with Pink Baby Roses and Purple Roses which are combined with White Veronica and Pink Hypericum mixed in with Steel Grass and White Eustoma as well as Snake Bamboo and Eucalyptus Leaves. This bouquet is the gift that anyone would highly appreciate receiving it on all occasions! The height is approximately 25 cm to 35 cm. The width is approximately 25 cm to 35 cm.</p>\"}', '{\"type\":\"simple\",\"featured\":false,\"weight\":\"\",\"dimensions\":{\"length\":\"\",\"width\":\"\",\"height\":\"\"},\"categories\":[{\"id\":167,\"name\":\"All Flowers\",\"slug\":\"all-flowers\"},{\"id\":141,\"name\":\"Best Seller\",\"slug\":\"best-seller\"},{\"id\":155,\"name\":\"Birthday\",\"slug\":\"birthday\"},{\"id\":186,\"name\":\"Eid\",\"slug\":\"eid\"},{\"id\":184,\"name\":\"For Her\",\"slug\":\"for-her\"},{\"id\":154,\"name\":\"For Mother\",\"slug\":\"for-mother\"},{\"id\":157,\"name\":\"Get well\",\"slug\":\"get-well\"},{\"id\":140,\"name\":\"I am Sorry\",\"slug\":\"i-am-sorry\"},{\"id\":158,\"name\":\"New Baby\",\"slug\":\"new-baby\"},{\"id\":139,\"name\":\"New Baby Girl\",\"slug\":\"new-baby-girl\"},{\"id\":159,\"name\":\"New job and promotion\",\"slug\":\"new-job-and-promotion\"},{\"id\":149,\"name\":\"Pink\",\"slug\":\"pink\"},{\"id\":188,\"name\":\"PINK OCTOBER\",\"slug\":\"pink-october\"},{\"id\":148,\"name\":\"White\",\"slug\":\"white\"}],\"tags\":[],\"wp_ar_id\":17766,\"wp_en_id\":14444}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '100', '350.00', '350.00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '1', '1', '10.00', NULL, NULL, '3_months', 'Other', NULL, NULL, '2026-10-01 09:50:58', '2026-10-13 13:13:52', NULL);
