g\":\"for-her\"},{\"id\":154,\"name\":\"For Mother\",\"slug\":\"for-mother\"},{\"id\":162,\"name\":\"Graduation\",\"slug\":\"graduation\"},{\"id\":164,\"name\":\"Hand Bouquet\",\"slug\":\"hand-bouquet\"},{\"id\":149,\"name\":\"Pink\",\"slug\":\"pink\"}],\"tags\":[],\"wp_ar_id\":17792,\"wp_en_id\":15026}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '100', '170.00', '170.00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '1', '1', '10.00', NULL, NULL, '3_months', 'Other', NULL, NULL, '2026-10-01 09:51:05', '2026-10-13 13:02:18', NULL);
INSERT INTO `products` (`id`, `source_id`, `user_id`, `category_id`, `production_id`, `sub_category_id`, `child_category_id`, `name`, `slug`, `slug_ar`, `sub_title`, `sku`, `image`, `gallery`, `description`, `meta_data`, `meta_tag_title`, `meta_tag_description`, `meta_tag_keywords`, `model`, `author`, `year`, `quantity`, `mrp`, `price`, `number_of_pages`, `book_language`, `weight`, `isbn`, `isbn10`, `isbn13`, `is_visible`, `is_subscription_enabled`, `subscription_discount_percentage`, `subscription_frequencies`, `subscription_durations`, `subscription_min_duration`, `type`, `updated_by`, `published_at`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `vendor_id`) VALUES ('352', '17794', NULL, '[31,50,51,48,6,21,15,4,45,22,23,12,53]', NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"G205\",\"ar\":\"G205\"}', 'g205', 'g205-2', '{\"en\":\"Enjoy an atmosphere of elegance and beauty with this luxurious white flower bouquet, featuring white tulips, hydrangeas, lilies, ostoma, and baby orchids. This exquisite bouquet includes 2 pieces of white hydrangeas, 10 pieces of white tulips, 3 pieces of white ostoma, 2 pieces of white liliums, and 5 pieces of baby orchids, complemented with fresh greenery for added sophistication and freshness. A perfect and complete choice for gifting your loved ones on special occasions or for adding a calm and elegant touch to your home décor.\\nHeight approximately 50 cm.\\nWidth approximately 40 cm.\",\"ar\":\"استمتع بأجواء من الرقي والجمال مع باقة الزهور البيضاء الفاخرة التي تجمع بين التوليب الأبيض، الهايدرنجا، الليليوم، الاستوما، والبيبي أوركيد. تأتي هذه الباقة المميزة التي تضم 2 قطع من الهايدرنجا الأبيض، 10 قطع من التوليب الأبيض، 3 قطع من الاستوما الأبيض، 2 قطع من الليليوم الأبيض، و5 قطع من البيبي أوركيد، مع لمسة من الخضار الطازج لإضفاء مزيد من الأناقة والانتعاش. هذه الباقة المتكاملة والمثالية هي الخيار الأمثل لإهداء أحبائك في المناسبات الخاصة أو تزيين منزلك بأجواء هادئة وفخمة.\\nالارتفاع حوالي 50 سم.\\nالعرض حوالي 40 سم.\"}', '277', 'products/2023/06/1-39.png', '[\"products\\/gallery\\/2023\\/06\\/1-39.png\",\"products\\/gallery\\/2023\\/06\\/2-42.png\",\"products\\/gallery\\/2023\\/06\\/3-40.png\",\"products\\/gallery\\/2023\\/06\\/4-37.png\",\"products\\/gallery\\/2023\\/06\\/5-19.png\"]', NULL, '{\"type\":\"simple\",\"featured\":false,\"weight\":\"\",\"dimensions\":{\"length\":\"\",\"width\":\"\",\"height\":\"\"},\"categories\":[{\"id\":167,\"name\":\"All Flowers\",\"slug\":\"all-flowers\"},{\"id\":186,\"name\":\"Eid\",\"slug\":\"eid\"},{\"id\":187,\"name\":\"For Father\",\"slug\":\"for-father\"},{\"id\":184,\"name\":\"For Her\",\"slug\":\"for-her\"},{\"id\":142,\"name\":\"For Him\",\"slug\":\"for-him\"},{\"id\":157,\"name\":\"Get well\",\"slug\":\"get-well\"},{\"id\":151,\"name\":\"Green\",\"slug\":\"green\"},{\"id\":140,\"name\":\"I am Sorry\",\"slug\":\"i-am-sorry\"},{\"id\":181,\"name\":\"National Day\",\"slug\":\"national-day\"},{\"id\":158,\"name\":\"New Baby\",\"slug\":\"new-baby\"},{\"id\":159,\"name\":\"New job and promotion\",\"slug\":\"new-job-and-promotion\"},{\"id\":148,\"name\":\"White\",\"slug\":\"white\"},{\"id\":189,\"name\":\"White Friday\",\"slug\":\"white-friday\"}],\"tags\":[],\"wp_ar_id\":17794,\"wp_en_id\":15294}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '100', '520.00', '520.00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '1', '1', '10.00', NULL, NULL, '3_months', 'Other', NULL, NULL, '2026-10-01 09:51:05', '2026-10-13 12:58:03', NULL);
INSERT INTO `products` (`id`, `source_id`, `user_id`, `category_id`, `production_id`, `sub_category_id`, `child_category_id`, `name`, `slug`, `slug_ar`, `sub_title`, `sku`, `image`, `gallery`, `description`, `meta_data`, `meta_tag_title`, `meta_tag_description`, `meta_tag_keywords`, `model`, `author`, `year`, `quantity`, `mrp`, `price`, `number_of_pages`, `book_language`, `weight`, `isbn`, `isbn10`, `isbn13`, `is_visible`, `is_subscription_enabled`, `subscription_discount_percentage`, `subscription_frequencies`, `subscription_durations`, `subscription_min_duration`, `type`, `updated_by`, `published_at`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `vendor_id`) VALUES ('353', '17802', NULL, '[31,50,48,18,21,26,28,16]', NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"G199\",\"ar\":\"G199\"}', 'g199', 'g199-2', '{\"en\":\"hand bouquet consisting of 35 purple and light pink roses, wax flowers, and purple Limonium. This beautiful bouquet also includes hydrangeas, white and dark purple roses, and dark purple Eustoma to add a charming smile to your loved one.\\nHeight approximately 60 cm.\\nWidth approximately 55 cm.\",\"ar\":\"باقة يد نابضة بالحياة، تتكون من 35 وردة بنفسجية ووردية فاتحة، وزهور الواكس الأبيض الرقيقة ، الليمونيوم البنفسجي. كما تضم ​​هذه الباقة الجميلة زهور الهيدرنجا والجوري الأبيض ، وزهرة الاستوما البنفسجية الداكنة، لإضفاء ابتسامة ساحرة على وجه من تحب.\\nالارتفاع حوالي 65 سم.\\nالعرض حوالي 55 سم.\"}', '271', 'products/2023/06/101-37.png', '[\"products\\/gallery\\/2023\\/06\\/101-37.png\",\"products\\/gallery\\/2023\\/06\\/102-36.png\",\"products\\/gallery\\/2023\\/06\\/103-37.png\",\"products\\/gallery\\/2023\\/06\\/104-31.png\",\"products\\/gallery\\/2023\\/06\\/105-23.png\"]', NULL, '{\"type\":\"simple\",\"featured\":false,\"weight\":\"\",\"dimensions\":{\"length\":\"\",\"width\":\"\",\"height\":\"\"},\"categories\":[{\"id\":167,\"name\":\"All Flowers\",\"slug\":\"all-flowers\"},{\"id\":186,\"name\":\"Eid\",\"slug\":\"eid\"},{\"id\":184,\"name\":\"For Her\",\"slug\":\"for-her\"},{\"id\":154,\"name\":\"For Mother\",\"slug\":\"for-mother\"},{\"id\":157,\"name\":\"Get well\",\"slug\":\"get-well\"},{\"id\":162,\"name\":\"Graduation\",\"slug\":\"graduation\"},{\"id\":164,\"name\":\"Hand Bouquet\",\"slug\":\"hand-bouquet\"},{\"id\":152,\"name\":\"Mixed\",\"slug\":\"mixed\"}],\"tags\":[],\"wp_ar_id\":17802,\"wp_en_id\":14744}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '100', '450.00', '450.00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '1', '1', '10.00', NULL, NULL, '3_months', 'Other', NULL, NULL, '2026-10-01 09:51:05', '2026-10-13 13:09:21', NULL);
INSERT INTO `products` (`id`, `source_id`, `user_id`, `category_id`, `production_id`, `sub_category_id`, `child_category_id`, `name`, `slug`, `slug_ar`, `sub_title`, `sku`, `image`, `gallery`, `description`, `meta_data`, `meta_tag_title`, `meta_tag_description`, `meta_tag_keywords`, `model`, `author`, `year`, `quantity`, `mrp`, `price`, `number_of_pages`, `book_language`, `weight`, `isbn`, `isbn10`, `isbn13`, `is_visible`, `is_subscription_enabled`, `subscription_discount_percentage`, `subscription_frequencies`, `subscription_durations`, `subscription_min_duration`, `type`, `updated_by`, `published_at`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `vendor_id`) VALUES ('354', '17804', NULL, '[31,5,19,50,48,18,21,22,3,23,13]', NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"G196\",\"ar\":\"G196\"}', 'g196', 'g196-2', '{\"en\":\"A luxurious arrangement that exudes elegance and harmony, featuring light pink hydrangea, roses in purple gradients, and pink lily, delicately complemented by white baby orchids, white alstroemerias, white chrysanthemums, and kermit, all enhanced with refined greenery for a natural, sophisticated touch. A design that reflects refined taste and genuine emotion — perfect for every occasion in a truly elegant style.\\nHeight approximately 55 cm.\\nWidth approximately 30 cm\",\"ar\":\"تنسيق فاخر يجمع بين الأناقة والرقي، يتألق بتدرجات الوردي والبنفسجي في مزيج متناغم من هايدرينجا وردي فاتح، واليليوم الوردي، تتخللها لمسات ناعمة من بيبي أوركيد أبيض، وآلستروميريا أبيض، وكريزنتيموم أبيض، مع كيرميت وخضار منسق بعناية تضيف لمسة طبيعية أنيقة. تصميم يعبر عن الذوق الرفيع والمشاعر الصادقة، ويليق بكل مناسبة بأسلوب راقٍ ومميز.\\nالارتفاع حوالي 55 سم.\\nالعرض حوالي 30 سم.\"}', '268', 'products/2023/06/1-26.png', '[\"products\\/gallery\\/2023\\/06\\/1-26.png\",\"products\\/gallery\\/2023\\/06\\/2-28.png\",\"products\\/gallery\\/2023\\/06\\/3-27.png\",\"products\\/gallery\\/2023\\/06\\/4-25.png\"]', '{\"en\":\"<p>A vibrant vase bouquet that is like a warm embrace which delivers your sentiments to someone special. A rich gathering of White Chrysanthemum, Pink Hypericum and White Baby Orchid mixed in with Pink Hydrangea and Pink Lilium, along with Steel Grass, Snake Bamboo, White Gypsophila and Roses of Purple and White. It\'s more than a gift - it\'s a way to express your feelings to them. The height is approximately 25 cm to 35 cm. The width is approximately 20 cm to 30 cm.</p>\",\"ar\":null}', '{\"type\":\"simple\",\"featured\":false,\"weight\":\"\",\"dimensions\":{\"length\":\"\",\"width\":\"\",\"height\":\"\"},\"categories\":[{\"id\":167,\"name\":\"All Flowers\",\"slug\":\"all-flowers\"},{\"id\":141,\"name\":\"Best Seller\",\"slug\":\"best-seller\"},{\"id\":155,\"name\":\"Birthday\",\"slug\":\"birthday\"},{\"id\":186,\"name\":\"Eid\",\"slug\":\"eid\"},{\"id\":184,\"name\":\"For Her\",\"slug\":\"for-her\"},{\"id\":154,\"name\":\"For Mother\",\"slug\":\"for-mother\"},{\"id\":157,\"name\":\"Get well\",\"slug\":\"get-well\"},{\"id\":158,\"name\":\"New Baby\",\"slug\":\"new-baby\"},{\"id\":139,\"name\":\"New Baby Girl\",\"slug\":\"new-baby-girl\"},{\"id\":159,\"name\":\"New job and promotion\",\"slug\":\"new-job-and-promotion\"},{\"id\":149,\"name\":\"Pink\",\"slug\":\"pink\"},{\"id\":194,\"name\":\"\\u0627\\u0644\\u0623\\u0641\\u0636\\u0644 \\u0645\\u0628\\u064a\\u0639\\u0627\\u064b\",\"slug\":\"%d8%a7%d9%84%d8%a3%d9%81%d8%b6%d9%84-%d9%85%d8%a8%d9%8a%d8%b9%d8%a7%d9%8b\"}],\"tags\":[],\"wp_ar_id\":17804,\"wp_en_id\":14748}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '100', '250.00', '250.00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '1', '1', '10.00', NULL, NULL, '3_months', 'Other', NULL, NULL, '2026-10-01 09:51:06', '2026-10-13 13:09:11', NULL);
INSERT INTO `products` (`id`, `source_id`, `user_id`, `category_id`, `production_id`, `sub_category_id`, `child_category_id`, `name`, `slug`, `slug_ar`, `sub_title`, `sku`, `image`, `gallery`, `description`, `meta_data`, `meta_tag_title`, `meta_tag_description`, `meta_tag_keywords`, `model`, `author`, `year`, `quantity`, `mrp`, `price`, `number_of_pages`, `book_language`, `weight`, `isbn`, `isbn10`, `isbn13`, `is_visible`, `is_subscription_enabled`, `subscription_discount_percentage`, `subscription_frequencies`, `subscription_durations`, `subscription_min_duration`, `type`, `updated_by`, `published_at`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `vendor_id`) VALUES ('355', '17806', NULL, '[31,50,48,6,21,15,45,23]', NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"G184\",\"ar\":\"G184\"}', 'g184', 'g184-2', '{\"en\":\"A fantastic modern vase bouquet with a charming arrangement inside a clear cylinder vase consists of Green Cymbidium and Green Kermit along with Steel Grass and Snake Bamboo all around. It is a beautiful way to show the sentiments you have inside your heart for your beloved one. The height is approximately 35 cm to 45 cm. The width is approximately 15 cm to 20 cm.\",\"ar\":\"اعطي لقلوب أحبائك رونقاً خاصًا من الفرح والبهجة الدائمة. باقة عصرية رائعة بترتيب ساحر داخل مزهرية أنيقة تحتوي على السمبيديوم والكيراميت الأخضر مع خضارات الإستيل وخضارات البامبو الملتوية. إنها طريقة جميلة لإظهار المشاعر التي تكنها داخل قلبك تجاه من تحب. الارتفاع حوالي 35 سم إلى 45 سم. العرض حوالي 15 سم إلى 20 سم.\"}', '256', 'products/2023/06/g18420send20flower20delivery-600x600-1.jpg', '[\"products\\/gallery\\/2023\\/06\\/g18420send20flower20delivery-600x600-1.jpg\",\"products\\/gallery\\/2023\\/06\\/g184-jeddah-flower-delivery-600x600-1.jpg\"]', NULL, '{\"type\":\"simple\",\"featured\":false,\"weight\":\"\",\"dimensions\":{\"length\":\"\",\"width\":\"\",\"height\":\"\"},\"categories\":[{\"id\":167,\"name\":\"All Flowers\",\"slug\":\"all-flowers\"},{\"id\":186,\"name\":\"Eid\",\"slug\":\"eid\"},{\"id\":184,\"name\":\"For Her\",\"slug\":\"for-her\"},{\"id\":142,\"name\":\"For Him\",\"slug\":\"for-him\"},{\"id\":157,\"name\":\"Get well\",\"slug\":\"get-well\"},{\"id\":151,\"name\":\"Green\",\"slug\":\"green\"},{\"id\":181,\"name\":\"National Day\",\"slug\":\"national-day\"},{\"id\":159,\"name\":\"New job and promotion\",\"slug\":\"new-job-and-promotion\"}],\"tags\":[],\"wp_ar_id\":17806,\"wp_en_id\":14752}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '100', '250.00', '250.00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '1', '1', '10.00', NULL, NULL, '3_months', 'Other', NULL, NULL, '2026-10-01 09:51:06', '2026-10-13 13:09:04', NULL);
