"For Mother\",\"slug\":\"for-mother\"},{\"id\":140,\"name\":\"I am Sorry\",\"slug\":\"i-am-sorry\"},{\"id\":144,\"name\":\"Red\",\"slug\":\"red\"}],\"tags\":[],\"wp_ar_id\":17818,\"wp_en_id\":15034}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '100', '600.00', '600.00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '1', '1', '10.00', NULL, NULL, '3_months', 'Other', NULL, NULL, '2026-10-01 09:51:06', '2026-10-13 13:02:00', NULL);
INSERT INTO `products` (`id`, `source_id`, `user_id`, `category_id`, `production_id`, `sub_category_id`, `child_category_id`, `name`, `slug`, `slug_ar`, `sub_title`, `sku`, `image`, `gallery`, `description`, `meta_data`, `meta_tag_title`, `meta_tag_description`, `meta_tag_keywords`, `model`, `author`, `year`, `quantity`, `mrp`, `price`, `number_of_pages`, `book_language`, `weight`, `isbn`, `isbn10`, `isbn13`, `is_visible`, `is_subscription_enabled`, `subscription_discount_percentage`, `subscription_frequencies`, `subscription_durations`, `subscription_min_duration`, `type`, `updated_by`, `published_at`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `vendor_id`) VALUES ('362', '17820', NULL, '[31,48,6,21,4,20,8]', NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"G164\",\"ar\":\"G164\"}', 'g164', 'g164-2', '{\"en\":\"When you want your present to make a genuine impression on your admired ones, this artistically designed bouquet will surely do the trick! bouquet in an elegant beautiful vase of 6 pcs of red roses and white chrysanthemums, making it one of the most luxurious bouquets in our store. We have added green Kermit and succulents. This lovely arrangement is designed to delight those close to your heart!\\nHeight approximately 25 cm.\\nWidth approximately  20 cm.\",\"ar\":\"اجعل من هذا اليوم خالداً في الذاكرة وكن الشخص الذي يضيء يومهم من خلال الترتيب الأنيق والمرموق لباقة في مزهرية أنيقة من 6 روز الاحمر الجميل, وكريزنتيموم الابيض مما يجعلها واحدة من أفخم الباقات في متجرنا. قمنا بالإضافة خضارات الكيرمت الأخضر مع خضارات الإستيل. تم تصميم هذا الترتيب اللطيف لإسعاد الأشخاص المقربين إلى قلبك!\\nالارتفاع حوالي 25 سم.\\nالعرض حوالي 20 سم.\"}', '236', 'products/2023/06/101-18.png', '[\"products\\/gallery\\/2023\\/06\\/101-18.png\",\"products\\/gallery\\/2023\\/06\\/102-17.png\",\"products\\/gallery\\/2023\\/06\\/103-17.png\"]', NULL, '{\"type\":\"simple\",\"featured\":false,\"weight\":\"\",\"dimensions\":{\"length\":\"\",\"width\":\"\",\"height\":\"\"},\"categories\":[{\"id\":167,\"name\":\"All Flowers\",\"slug\":\"all-flowers\"},{\"id\":184,\"name\":\"For Her\",\"slug\":\"for-her\"},{\"id\":142,\"name\":\"For Him\",\"slug\":\"for-him\"},{\"id\":157,\"name\":\"Get well\",\"slug\":\"get-well\"},{\"id\":140,\"name\":\"I am Sorry\",\"slug\":\"i-am-sorry\"},{\"id\":156,\"name\":\"Love\",\"slug\":\"love\"},{\"id\":144,\"name\":\"Red\",\"slug\":\"red\"}],\"tags\":[],\"wp_ar_id\":17820,\"wp_en_id\":16406}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '100', '180.00', '180.00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '1', '1', '10.00', NULL, NULL, '3_months', 'Other', NULL, NULL, '2026-10-01 09:51:06', '2026-10-13 12:46:30', NULL);
