irthday\",\"slug\":\"birthday\"},{\"id\":184,\"name\":\"For Her\",\"slug\":\"for-her\"},{\"id\":142,\"name\":\"For Him\",\"slug\":\"for-him\"},{\"id\":154,\"name\":\"For Mother\",\"slug\":\"for-mother\"},{\"id\":157,\"name\":\"Get well\",\"slug\":\"get-well\"},{\"id\":140,\"name\":\"I am Sorry\",\"slug\":\"i-am-sorry\"},{\"id\":156,\"name\":\"Love\",\"slug\":\"love\"},{\"id\":158,\"name\":\"New Baby\",\"slug\":\"new-baby\"},{\"id\":139,\"name\":\"New Baby Girl\",\"slug\":\"new-baby-girl\"},{\"id\":159,\"name\":\"New job and promotion\",\"slug\":\"new-job-and-promotion\"},{\"id\":144,\"name\":\"Red\",\"slug\":\"red\"},{\"id\":183,\"name\":\"Valentine\",\"slug\":\"valentine\"}],\"tags\":[],\"wp_ar_id\":17870,\"wp_en_id\":15050}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '100', '280.00', '280.00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '1', '1', '10.00', NULL, NULL, '3_months', 'Other', NULL, NULL, '2026-10-01 09:51:08', '2026-10-13 13:01:43', NULL);
INSERT INTO `products` (`id`, `source_id`, `user_id`, `category_id`, `production_id`, `sub_category_id`, `child_category_id`, `name`, `slug`, `slug_ar`, `sub_title`, `sku`, `image`, `gallery`, `description`, `meta_data`, `meta_tag_title`, `meta_tag_description`, `meta_tag_keywords`, `model`, `author`, `year`, `quantity`, `mrp`, `price`, `number_of_pages`, `book_language`, `weight`, `isbn`, `isbn10`, `isbn13`, `is_visible`, `is_subscription_enabled`, `subscription_discount_percentage`, `subscription_frequencies`, `subscription_durations`, `subscription_min_duration`, `type`, `updated_by`, `published_at`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `vendor_id`) VALUES ('384', '17872', NULL, '[31,51,48,6,20]', NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"G110\",\"ar\":\"G110\"}', 'g110', 'g110-2', '{\"en\":\"This bouquet is dexterously designed by our team of extremely talented florists to help you in making them feel special. A sumptuous vase bouquet consists of Red Roses along with Steel Grass that makes it the most suitable present to show how much you appreciate your loved ones’ presence in your life!\\nThe height is approximately 20 cm to 30 cm.\\nThe width is approximately 20 cm to 30 cm.\",\"ar\":\"باقة مليئة بالمشاعر والتعابير الراقية في مزهرية فاخرة صُممت بمهارة من قبل فريقنا الشغوف حتى يشعر من أحببت بالتميز. هدية أنيقة تتكون من الروز الأحمر مع خضارات الإستيل مما يجعلها أنسب طريقة لإظهار مدى تقديرك لوجود أحبائك في حياتك!\\nالارتفاع حوالي 20 سم إلى 30 سم.\\nالعرض حوالي 20 سم إلى 30 سم.\"}', '182', 'products/2023/06/g11020jeddah20flower20delivery202-600x600-1.jpg', '[\"products\\/gallery\\/2023\\/06\\/g11020jeddah20flower20delivery202-600x600-1.jpg\",\"products\\/gallery\\/2023\\/06\\/g11020jeddah20flower20delivery203-600x600-1.jpg\",\"products\\/gallery\\/2023\\/06\\/g11020jeddah20flower20delivery204-600x600-1.jpg\",\"products\\/gallery\\/2023\\/06\\/g11020jeddah20flower20delivery-600x600-1.jpg\",\"products\\/gallery\\/2023\\/06\\/g110-jeddah-flower-delivery-1-600x600-1.jpg\"]', NULL, '{\"type\":\"simple\",\"featured\":false,\"weight\":\"\",\"dimensions\":{\"length\":\"\",\"width\":\"\",\"height\":\"\"},\"categories\":[{\"id\":167,\"name\":\"All Flowers\",\"slug\":\"all-flowers\"},{\"id\":187,\"name\":\"For Father\",\"slug\":\"for-father\"},{\"id\":184,\"name\":\"For Her\",\"slug\":\"for-her\"},{\"id\":142,\"name\":\"For Him\",\"slug\":\"for-him\"},{\"id\":156,\"name\":\"Love\",\"slug\":\"love\"}],\"tags\":[],\"wp_ar_id\":17872,\"wp_en_id\":15152}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '100', '500.00', '500.00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '1', '1', '10.00', NULL, NULL, '3_months', 'Other', NULL, NULL, '2026-10-01 09:51:08', '2026-10-13 12:59:53', NULL);
INSERT INTO `products` (`id`, `source_id`, `user_id`, `category_id`, `production_id`, `sub_category_id`, `child_category_id`, `name`, `slug`, `slug_ar`, `sub_title`, `sku`, `image`, `gallery`, `description`, `meta_data`, `meta_tag_title`, `meta_tag_description`, `meta_tag_keywords`, `model`, `author`, `year`, `quantity`, `mrp`, `price`, `number_of_pages`, `book_language`, `weight`, `isbn`, `isbn10`, `isbn13`, `is_visible`, `is_subscription_enabled`, `subscription_discount_percentage`, `subscription_frequencies`, `subscription_durations`, `subscription_min_duration`, `type`, `updated_by`, `published_at`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `vendor_id`) VALUES ('385', '17874', NULL, '[31,24]', NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"G108\",\"ar\":\"G108\"}', 'g108', 'g108-2', '{\"en\":\"This elegant bouquet is skillfully designed with refined taste to leave an unforgettable impression. Featuring soft shades of white and green that evoke purity and tranquility, it makes a refreshing and joyful gift for any occasion. The arrangement includes 30 white roses, white cymbidium orchids, lilies, and white hydrangeas, beautifully interwoven with white baby roses and Eustoma. Elegant touches of white tulips and baby orchids complement the bouquet, along with accents of curly wood sticks and steel grass. \\nThis floral gift touches the heart, expressing sincere gratitude and thanks, or offering a message of hope and healing to your loved ones. It also makes a wonderful choice for celebrating special occasions, making those moments truly special and full of warmth.The perfect choice for anyone who deserves unforgettable moments.\\nHeight: approximately 95 to 110 cm\\nWidth: approximately 60 to 65 cm\",\"ar\":\"صُممت هذه الباقة الأنيقة بمهارة وذوق رفيع، لتترك انطباعًا لا يُنسى. باضافة درجات الأبيض والأخضر الناعمة للشعور بالنقاء والهدوء، ما يجعلها هدية منعشة ومبهجة لأي مناسبة. ، حيث تحتوي على30 من الجوري الأبيض وزهور السمبيديوم الأبيض, والليليوم والهيدرنيجا الأبيض, مع تداخل البيبي الجوري والاستوما الابيض, مع لمسات من التوليب والبيبي الاوركيد الانيقة, متداخل معها اعواد الخشب الكورليس والستيل غراس .باقة الزهور هذه تلامس القلب، تعبر عن الامتنان الصادق والشكر، أو تقدم رسالة أمل وشفاء لمن تحب، كما تُعد خيارًا رائعًا للاحتفال بالمناسبات الخاصة، لتجعل لحظاتهم مميزة ومليئة بالدفء.\\nالاختيار المثالي لكل من يستحق لحظات لا تُنسى.\\nالارتفاع حوالي 95 سم إلى 110 سم.\\nالعرض حوالي 60 سم إلى65 سم.\"}', '180', 'products/2023/06/105-2.jpg', '[\"products\\/gallery\\/2023\\/06\\/105-2.jpg\",\"products\\/gallery\\/2023\\/06\\/106-6.jpg\",\"products\\/gallery\\/2023\\/06\\/102-3.jpg\",\"products\\/gallery\\/2023\\/06\\/101-15.jpg\",\"products\\/gallery\\/2023\\/06\\/103-2.jpg\"]', NULL, '{\"type\":\"simple\",\"featured\":false,\"weight\":\"\",\"dimensions\":{\"length\":\"\",\"width\":\"\",\"height\":\"\"},\"categories\":[{\"id\":167,\"name\":\"All Flowers\",\"slug\":\"all-flowers\"},{\"id\":160,\"name\":\"Luxury Bouquets\",\"slug\":\"luxury-bouquets\"}],\"tags\":[],\"wp_ar_id\":17874,\"wp_en_id\":16656}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '100', '1400.00', '1400.00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '1', '1', '10.00', NULL, NULL, '3_months', 'Other', NULL, NULL, '2026-10-01 09:51:08', '2026-10-13 12:41:16', NULL);
INSERT INTO `products` (`id`, `source_id`, `user_id`, `category_id`, `production_id`, `sub_category_id`, `child_category_id`, `name`, `slug`, `slug_ar`, `sub_title`, `sku`, `image`, `gallery`, `description`, `meta_data`, `meta_tag_title`, `meta_tag_description`, `meta_tag_keywords`, `model`, `author`, `year`, `quantity`, `mrp`, `price`, `number_of_pages`, `book_language`, `weight`, `isbn`, `isbn10`, `isbn13`, `is_visible`, `is_subscription_enabled`, `subscription_discount_percentage`, `subscription_frequencies`, `subscription_durations`, `subscription_min_duration`, `type`, `updated_by`, `published_at`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `vendor_id`) VALUES ('386', '17876', NULL, '[31,19,48,6,21,28,4,16,22,3,23]', NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"G105\",\"ar\":\"G105\"}', 'g105', 'g105-2', '{\"en\":\"Our skilled florists have designed this gorgeous hand bouquet that will make you the reason for their dazzling smile. Capture the moment with your beloved ones and lighten up their day by gifting a luxurious bouquet that consists of stunning Double Coloured Fuchsia Roses. Along with Purple and Dark Pink Roses mixed in with several White Gypsophila, and Purple Chrysanthemum along with Eucalyptus Leaves to add a touch of greenery. Bring joy into their life! The height is approximately 40 cm to 50 cm. The width is approximately 25 cm to 35 cm.\",\"ar\":\"اجعل حياة من أحببت أكثر تألقاً بألوان متآلفة مع الطبيعة الخلابة. استمتع بإهداء باقة فاخرة تتكون من الروز الفوشي ثنائي اللون مع الروز باللون البنفسجي والوردي الداكن، كما أن هذه الباقة تحتوي على الجيبسوفيليا البيضاء والكريزنتيموم البنفسجي مع خضارات الإكلابتوس لإضافة لمسة مشرقة تسعد أعزائك. الارتفاع حوالي 40 سم إلى 50 سم. العرض حوالي 25 سم إلى 35 سم.\"}', '177', 'products/2023/06/g10520send20flower20to20jeddah-600x600-1.jpg', '[\"products\\/gallery\\/2023\\/06\\/g10520send20flower20to20jeddah-600x600-1.jpg\",\"products\\/gallery\\/2023\\/06\\/g10520send20flowers20to20jeddah-600x600-1.jpg\",\"products\\/gallery\\/2023\\/06\\/g105-jeddah-flower-delivery-600x600-1.jpg\"]', NULL, '{\"type\":\"simple\",\"featured\":false,\"weight\":\"\",\"dimensions\":{\"length\":\"\",\"width\":\"\",\"height\":\"\"},\"categories\":[{\"id\":167,\"name\":\"All Flowers\",\"slug\":\"all-flowers\"},{\"id\":155,\"name\":\"Birthday\",\"slug\":\"birthday\"},{\"id\":184,\"name\":\"For Her\",\"slug\":\"for-her\"},{\"id\":142,\"name\":\"For Him\",\"slug\":\"for-him\"},{\"id\":157,\"name\":\"Get well\",\"slug\":\"get-well\"},{\"id\":164,\"name\":\"Hand Bouquet\",\"slug\":\"hand-bouquet\"},{\"id\":140,\"name\":\"I am Sorry\",\"slug\":\"i-am-sorry\"},{\"id\":152,\"name\":\"Mixed\",\"slug\":\"mixed\"},{\"id\":158,\"name\":\"New Baby\",\"slug\":\"new-baby\"},{\"id\":139,\"name\":\"New Baby Girl\",\"slug\":\"new-baby-girl\"},{\"id\":159,\"name\":\"New job and promotion\",\"slug\":\"new-job-and-promotion\"}],\"tags\":[],\"wp_ar_id\":17876,\"wp_en_id\":14808}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '100', '150.00', '150.00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '1', '1', '10.00', NULL, NULL, '3_months', 'Other', NULL, NULL, '2026-10-01 09:51:09', '2026-10-13 13:07:54', NULL);
INSERT INTO `products` (`id`, `source_id`, `user_id`, `category_id`, `production_id`, `sub_category_id`, `child_category_id`, `name`, `slug`, `slug_ar`, `sub_title`, `sku`, `image`, `gallery`, `description`, `meta_data`, `meta_tag_title`, `meta_tag_description`, `meta_tag_keywords`, `model`, `author`, `year`, `quantity`, `mrp`, `price`, `number_of_pages`, `book_language`, `weight`, `isbn`, `isbn10`, `isbn13`, `is_visible`, `is_subscription_enabled`, `subscription_discount_percentage`, `subscription_frequencies`, `subscription_durations`, `subscription_min_duration`, `type`, `updated_by`, `published_at`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `vendor_id`) VALUES ('387', '17878', NULL, '[31,5,6,21,28,25,12]', NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"G104\",\"ar\":\"G104\"}', 'g104', 'g104-2', '{\"en\":\"A graceful bouquet that radiates elegance and charm, featuring six pink liliums beautifully arranged with white gypsophila for a perfectly balanced look. Its simple yet sophisticated design makes it an ideal choice to express appreciation, gratitude, or add a refined touch to any occasion.\",\"ar\":\"باقة ليلية وردية تنبض بالأنوثة والرقي، تضم ست زهور ليلوم وردية تتفتح برقة حول لمسات من الجبسوفيليا البيضاء وخضار طبيعي يمنحها توازنًا جميلًا. تنسيق بسيط وأنيق يجمع بين الجمال الكلاسيكي والطابع العصري، مثالي للتعبير عن التقدير، الامتنان، أو لمسة راقية في أي مناسبة.\\nالارتفاع حوالي 35 سم.\\nالعرض حوالي 25 سم.\"}', '176', 'products/2023/06/1-31.png', '[\"products\\/gallery\\/2023\\/06\\/1-31.png\",\"products\\/gallery\\/2023\\/06\\/2-33.png\",\"products\\/gallery\\/2023\\/06\\/3-32.png\",\"products\\/gallery\\/2023\\/06\\/4-30.png\",\"products\\/gallery\\/2023\\/06\\/5-15.png\"]', NULL, '{\"type\":\"simple\",\"featured\":false,\"weight\":\"\",\"dimensions\":{\"length\":\"\",\"width\":\"\",\"height\":\"\"},\"categories\":[{\"id\":167,\"name\":\"All Flowers\",\"slug\":\"all-flowers\"},{\"id\":141,\"name\":\"Best Seller\",\"slug\":\"best-seller\"},{\"id\":142,\"name\":\"For Him\",\"slug\":\"for-him\"},{\"id\":157,\"name\":\"Get well\",\"slug\":\"get-well\"},{\"id\":164,\"name\":\"Hand Bouquet\",\"slug\":\"hand-bouquet\"},{\"id\":161,\"name\":\"Thank You\",\"slug\":\"thank-you\"},{\"id\":148,\"name\":\"White\",\"slug\":\"white\"},{\"id\":194,\"name\":\"\\u0627\\u0644\\u0623\\u0641\\u0636\\u0644 \\u0645\\u0628\\u064a\\u0639\\u0627\\u064b\",\"slug\":\"%d8%a7%d9%84%d8%a3%d9%81%d8%b6%d9%84-%d9%85%d8%a8%d9%8a%d8%b9%d8%a7%d9%8b\"}],\"tags\":[],\"wp_ar_id\":17878,\"wp_en_id\":16660}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '100', '150.00', '150.00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '1', '1', '10.00', NULL, NULL, '3_months', 'Other', NULL, NULL, '2026-10-01 09:51:09', '2026-10-13 12:41:12', NULL);
INSERT INTO `products` (`id`, `source_id`, `user_id`, `category_id`, `production_id`, `sub_category_id`, `child_category_id`, `name`, `slug`, `slug_ar`, `sub_title`, `sku`, `image`, `gallery`, `description`, `meta_data`, `meta_tag_title`, `meta_tag_description`, `meta_tag_keywords`, `model`, `author`, `year`, `quantity`, `mrp`, `price`, `number_of_pages`, `book_language`, `weight`, `isbn`, `isbn10`, `isbn13`, `is_visible`, `is_subscription_enabled`, `subscription_discount_percentage`, `subscription_frequencies`, `subscription_durations`, `subscription_min_duration`, `type`, `updated_by`, `published_at`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `vendor_id`) VALUES ('388', '17880', NULL, '[31,17,42,60,48,6,18,21,15,45,23,12]', NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"en\":\"G103\",\"ar\":\"G103\"}', 'g103', 'g103-2', '{\"en\":\"The beautiful, calming, and soothing colors of this basket bouquet make it a wonderful gift for a congratulatory message or any other occasion!\\nA stunning basket bouquet of light green cymbidium flowers and white roses, along with green kermit flowers, steel greens, and twisted bamboo, adds a touch of calm and serenity to this wonderful gift.\\nIt measures approximately 40-50 cm in height and 30-40 cm in width.\",\"ar\":\"الألوان الجميلة والهادئة والمريحة تجعل هذه الباقة الهدية الملائمة للتعبير عن أجمل المشاعر وألطفها.\\nباقة في سلة أنيقة تحتوي على السمبيديوم الأخضر الفاتح والروز الأبيض مع زهور الكيرميت الأخضر وخضارات الإستيل والبامبو الملتوية لخلق صورة نهائية للجمال في هذه الهدية الرائعة لمسةً من الهدوء والسكينة!\\nالارتفاع حوالي 40 سم إلى 50 سم. العرض حوالي 30 سم إلى 40 سم.\"}', '175', 'products/2023/06/a-1.jpg', '[\"products\\/gallery\\/2023\\/06\\/a-1.jpg\",\"products\\/gallery\\/2023\\/06\\/101-1jpgs-1.jpg\",\"products\\/gallery\\/2023\\/06\\/101-2jpga-2.jpg\",\"products\\/gallery\\/2023\\/06\\/101-6.jpg\",\"products\\/gallery\\/2023\\/06\\/101-2jpgz-2.jpg\"]', NULL, '{\"type\":\"simple\",\"featured\":false,\"weight\":\"\",\"dimensions\":{\"length\":\"\",\"width\":\"\",\"height\":\"\"},\"categories\":[{\"id\":167,\"name\":\"All Flowers\",\"slug\":\"all-flowers\"},{\"id\":153,\"name\":\"All Occasions\",\"slug\":\"all-occasions\"},{\"id\":178,\"name\":\"Bridal Bouquet\",\"slug\":\"bridal-bouquet\"},{\"id\":270,\"name\":\"Flag Day\",\"slug\":\"flag-day\"},{\"id\":184,\"name\":\"For Her\",\"slug\":\"for-her\"},{\"id\":142,\"name\":\"For Him\",\"slug\":\"for-him\"},{\"id\":154,\"name\":\"For Mother\",\"slug\":\"for-mother\"},{\"id\":157,\"name\":\"Get well\",\"slug\":\"get-well\"},{\"id\":151,\"name\":\"Green\",\"slug\":\"green\"},{\"id\":181,\"name\":\"National Day\",\"slug\":\"national-day\"},{\"id\":159,\"name\":\"New job and promotion\",\"slug\":\"new-job-and-promotion\"},{\"id\":148,\"name\":\"White\",\"slug\":\"white\"}],\"tags\":[],\"wp_ar_id\":17880,\"wp_en_id\":15156}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '100', '500.00', '500.00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '1', '1', '10.00', NULL, NULL, '3_months', 'Other', NULL, NULL, '2026-10-01 09:51:09', '2026-10-13 12:59:49', NULL);
